Here is the commit message:
HADOOP-12407. Test failing: hadoop.ipc.TestSaslRPC. (stevel)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the test case `testSaslPlainServerBadPassword` in `TestSaslRPC.java` expecting an exact error message when authentication failed. This strict check led to test failures when the actual error message varied slightly, indicating that the test was not robust enough to handle different error message formats.

